Invidia Claritatis
==================

This project began as a fork of Kizzuwatnaa/DLSS5-Autopilot
(https://github.com/Kizzuwatnaa/DLSS5-Autopilot), used under the MIT licence,
and is being rewritten from scratch in C#. The original's copyright notice is
kept in LICENSE, beside this project's. The original Python code is kept in
this repository's history under the tag `python-reference`.

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers only this project's own source code. The tool
downloads third-party components at run time; those remain under their own
licences. In particular the DLSS 5 neural-rendering add-on and the NVIDIA NGX
runtimes are proprietary software and are NOT contained in this repository or
its release archives.
